        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\nfetch_api_key.py - fetches an API key from a managed secrets store\nfetch_db_secret.py - fetches a database connection secret at runtime\nparse_json_secret.py - retrieves and parses a JSON-formatted secret\nrotate_secret_version.py - reads a specific secret version or staged value\nrotation_summary.py - Summarize secret rotation status\nrunbook_translate.py - Translate secret-rotation runbook notes\nsecret_audit_embedding.py - Embed secret audit notes for semantic search\nsecret_label_safety.py - Check secret labels and notes for unsafe text\nsecurity_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Secret Management\nsecurity_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Secret Management\n\nCreate fetch_db_secret.py in the current working directory.\nTask: fetches a database connection secret at runtime.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
