        "text": "**Choosing Secret Manager**\n\nI've decided to use Google Cloud Secret Manager. Now I'm focusing on the implementation details and how to integrate it within the Python script, `fetch_db_secret.py`. I'm thinking about the best approach to handle authentication and error management within the script.\n\n\n**Implementing Secret Retrieval**\n\nI've got the `fetch_db_secret.py` file set up and am integrating the Google Cloud Secret Manager library. My code now includes the necessary imports and the client initialization to interact with the secret manager. I'm focusing on crafting the retrieval logic with the necessary exception handling. The provider-specific signals are in place. Next, I'll be working on error management.\n\n\n**Defining Secret Integration**\n\nI'm now fully committed to integrating Google Cloud Secret Manager for fetching the database secret in `fetch_db_secret.py`. The provider-specific signals are in place, with the necessary import and client initialization. My focus now is on retrieving the secret value and managing potential errors that might arise during the process. I am building the basic structure for the application.\n\n\n",
